'''Doppo Cat''' is a [[:Category:Special Cats|Special Cat]] that can be obtained from the [[Baki Hanma Collaboration Event/Event Gacha|Event Capsule]] during the [[Baki Hanma Collaboration Event]]. He was added in [[Version 14.3 Update|Version 14.3]].

{{Cat Info
|ID = 798
|rarity = EX
|name1 = Doppo Cat
|name2 = Doppo Cat CC
}}

==Evolution==
Evolves into '''Doppo Cat CC''' at level 10.

==Strategy/Usage==
Doppo Cat is viable throughout [[Empire of Cats]] and early [[Stories of Legend]]. Otherwise, his [[Freeze]] activation rate is terribly low, too much to be optimal for any situation. Once [[Witch Cat (Rare Cat)|Witch Cat]] is obtained, she tends to outclass him in almost any relevant situation due to her spammability and fast attack rate.

{{Job|Classification = Crowd-Controller & User Rank Dump}}

